flowchart TB
    User([User / Browser])
    IaC["CloudFormation / AWS SAM<br/>YAML — provisions everything"]

    subgraph AWS["AWS Cloud"]
        subgraph Edge["Frontend / Edge"]
            CF[CloudFront CDN]
            S3[(S3 — React build)]
        end

        Cognito[Cognito User Pool<br/>issues + validates JWT]

        subgraph APIL["API Layer"]
            APIGW[API Gateway<br/>+ Cognito authorizer]
            AppLambda[App Lambda — Node.js<br/>CRUD + reports]
        end

        subgraph Data["VPC — private subnets"]
            DB[(Aurora Serverless v2 · PostgreSQL<br/>min 0 ACU / auto-pause)]
        end

        Secrets[Secrets Manager]
        CW[CloudWatch]
        VPCe[VPC Endpoints<br/>no NAT gateway]
    end

    User -->|HTTPS| CF
    CF -->|static assets| S3
    User -->|1. login| Cognito
    User -->|2. API call + JWT| APIGW
    APIGW -->|validate token| Cognito
    APIGW -->|3. invoke w/ user claims| AppLambda
    AppLambda -->|4. SQL scoped to userId| DB


    AppLambda -.creds.-> Secrets
    AppLambda -.logs.-> CW
    AppLambda -.reach AWS APIs.-> VPCe
    IaC -.provisions all.-> AWS
